{"id":"exactamente","lemma":"exactamente","pos":"adv","rank":328,"glosses":["exactly"],"ipa":"/eɡˌsaɡtaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-exactamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom hizo exactamente eso.","en":"Tom did just that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/299978"},{"text":"¿En dónde exactamente estamos?","en":"Where are we exactly?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454609"},{"text":"Sé exactamente qué hacer.","en":"I know just what to do.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459324"},{"text":"¿Exactamente cómo lo hiciste?","en":"How exactly did you do it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587319"},{"text":"¿Exactamente qué pasó aquí?","en":"Exactly what happened here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606552"}]}